{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50829","headline":"登天都峯 · 缪岛云","name":"登天都峯","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盘空千万仞，险若上丹梯。\n迥入天都里，回看鸟道低。\n他山青点点，远水白凄凄。\n欲下前峯暝，岩间宿锦鸡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缪岛云","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}